    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hegarty Properties are delighted to present this superb detached home at No. 1 Chestnut Drive, ideally located within a short walk of Midleton town centre. This excellent position offers a wide range of amenities — shops, restaurants, cinema, bars, the train station, bus stops and schools — all within easy walking distance, while the N25 provides a short commute to Cork City.\r\nThis impressive, Heritage-built detached residence, dating from 1990, enjoys a superb setting overlooking a large green area and benefits from a generous rear garden, which offers an ideal space for outdoor activities, entertaining and relaxation.\r\nExtending to approximately 138 sq. m., the accommodation is bright, spacious and versatile. \r\nCombining a prime location, generous living accommodation, a sunny garden and excellent amenities, No. 1 Chestnut Drive represents an ideal opportunity to acquire a superb family home in the heart of Midleton.\r\n\r\nAccommodation: Entrance Hall, Sitting Room, Kitchen/Dining/Living Room, Utility Room, 5 Bedrooms (2 ensuites) and Family Bathroom. (c. 138 sq. m).\r\n\r\nPrice Guide: €480,000"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation:\r\nGround Floor:         \r\nEntrance Hall:\tWelcoming entrance hall with tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nSitting Room: \tBright front-aspect room with carpet flooring and an open fireplace.\r\nDining Room/\r\nSitting room:\tA well-appointed room with vinyl flooring and an open fireplace with stonework detailing. Double doors provide access to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining:\tFitted kitchen with electric double oven, hob, fridge. Fully tiled splashback and tiled flooring.\t\t\r\n\r\nBedroom 5:\tBright front aspect room with lino flooring and ensuite. \r\nEnsuite: \tElectric shower, w.c. & w.h.b.             \t\r\n\r\nUtility Room/\r\nLaundry:\tPlumbed for washing machine & dryer.  Tiled flooring and door to side entrance and rear garden.\r\nUpstairs:\r\nMaster Bedroom:\tSpacious, carpeted flooring room. Front aspect.\r\nEn-suite:\t\tElectric shower, w.c. & w.h.b. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2:\t\tRear aspect, double room with carpeted flooring. \r\n\t\t\t\r\nBedroom 3:          \tFront aspect, double room with carpeted flooring. \r\n\r\nBedroom 4:          \tFront aspect, single room with vinyl flooring.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom:\tBath, W.C. & W.H.B.\r\n\t                          \r\nOutside:\tExternally, the property enjoys a generous front garden with mature hedging, established planting and a private driveway providing ample off-street parking. A generous rear garden compliments this home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Special Features:\r\n•\tDetached family home extending to approx. 138 sq. m.\r\n•\tSpacious and versatile living accommodation over two floors\r\n•\tGenerous rear garden\r\n•\tMature, established residential setting with good privacy\r\n•\tP.V.C. double-glazed windows\r\n•\tSuperb location within easy walking distance of Midleton town centre\r\n•\tEasy access to the N25, providing convenient connectivity to Cork City\r\n•\tEircode: P25 HE18\r\n\r\nServices:\tO.F.C.H., Mains Water & Mains Drainage."
      },
